__yy__v2412.gmlDesc=(__yy_gml_array_create(["[EMPLOYEE NOTICE: This description has been redacted. Please report any and all broken and/or malfunctioning equipment to managerial staff for proper disposal. Do not touch, move, communicate with, or look away from the model as you wait for assistance. We thank you for your cooperation.]","Springtrap is another character whose mechanic completely changed between Frickbear's 2 and 3, though he's an especially funny case since he went from being (arguably) the single easiest character to deal with in 2 to (arguably) the single hardest in 3. Maybe he's a bit unbalanced, but I figure him demanding as much attention as he does is fitting for the main antagonist of the series. After all, would it really be Springtrap if he wasn't a jerk?"]));
